xt":"A second-year student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka was elected as the student council president in her first year. Now in her sophomore year, she handles the council's responsibilities single-handedly. Her excellent grades and motor skills have always put her at the top of her class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her captivating looks have made her popular among the male students, leading her to be perceived as a flower on a high peak, an unattainable gem, and earning her the nickname \"Ice Princess.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka forms an unexpected connection with the protagonist, Asuma Hayato, due to a light-hearted mix-up involving their similar-sounding names, \"Asuma\" and \"Asuka.\" As a result, she invites Hayato to participate in student council activities under the guise of monitoring his actions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her many accomplishments, she isn't good at socializing with others, nor does she imagine herself falling in love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114015"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d661cf29789270a90c5e67e2d307d0c61d236dc52f9636e1b975a7bda4c115da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b00a690d1660732bac81f5b439ad9cc581905a7ed8c911dde316f9498f0b918d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雛咲 もも","creatorId":"vndb:s44852","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s44852","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s44852","name":"島袋 美由利","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92302","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c122133","characterName":"ダビデ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c122133"},"originalCharacterName":"ダビデ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate